# tccompare must also compare the length of both strings
Chiqish yozish: (['secret'] tccompare: ['']), yangi-qator.
Chiqish yozish: ([''] tccompare: ['secret']), yangi-qator.
Chiqish yozish: (['secret'] tccompare: ['sec']), yangi-qator.
Chiqish yozish: (['sec'] tccompare: ['secret']), yangi-qator.
Chiqish yozish: (['secret'] tccompare: ['secret']), yangi-qator.
Chiqish yozish: ([''] tccompare: ['']), yangi-qator.
